{"kind":"stack","id":"s-sound","title":"Sound and vibrations","theme":{"background":"#1e3a5f","foreground":"#ffffff","font":"Arial, sans-serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-t","content":"Vibration"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-e","content":"A quick back-and-forth movement of an object. Vibrations make sound."},{"type":"button","id":"c1-n","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-q","content":"What must a sound travel through to reach your ear?"},{"type":"button","id":"c2-a","label":"A medium such as air","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-b","label":"Nothing, sound jumps straight in","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-c","label":"Only solid objects","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"What kind of movement makes a sound?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"Vibration","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"Stillness","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"Heating","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-t","content":"You hear a drum in the hall. Do you go closer to listen, or cover your ears?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"Go closer to listen","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Cover your ears","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-t","content":"Closer to the drum, the sound is louder. Its vibrations reach your ear more strongly."},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"With your ears covered, the sound is muffled. The vibrations still travel, but fewer reach you."},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-q","content":"Which medium carries sound best of these?"},{"type":"button","id":"c7-a","label":"Water","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c7-b","label":"Air","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c7-c","label":"A vacuum","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-q","content":"What part of your ear picks up the vibrations first?"},{"type":"button","id":"c8-a","label":"Eardrum","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-b","label":"Eyelid","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-c","label":"Fingernail","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-t","content":"Medium"},{"type":"text","id":"c9-e","content":"The material, such as air, water or metal, that sound travels through."},{"type":"button","id":"c9-n","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-q","content":"Sound cannot travel through which of these?"},{"type":"button","id":"c10-a","label":"A vacuum with no particles","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-b","label":"Air","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-c","label":"Wood","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c11","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c11-h","content":"Well done! You finished sound and vibrations."},{"type":"text","id":"c11-m","content":"Sound travels as vibrations through a medium until it reaches your ear."}],"actions":[]}}
